                            <comment id="16247751" author="amashenkov" created="Fri, 10 Nov 2017 16:41:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Update PR against fresh master.&lt;br/&gt;
TC looks fine.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16268378" author="sboikov" created="Tue, 28 Nov 2017 08:35:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I reviewed changes, have some comments:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;code for message&apos;s writeTo/readFrom should be generated automatically using MessageCodeGenerator, I fixed this&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;you added in GridJobProcessor.JobDiscoveryListener processing of EVT_NODE_JOINED. First it does not actually process EVT_NODE_JOINED since you need add EVT_NODE_JOINED for listener registration (ctx.event().addLocalEventListener(discoLsnr, EVT_NODE_FAILED, EVT_NODE_LEFT ...). Second processing of EVT_NODE_JOINED should not use the same logic as processing of EVT_NODE_FAILED. I think you need add test which will fail if GridJobProcessor.JobDiscoveryListener does not process EVT_NODE_JOINED and fix it in correct way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16276887" author="amashenkov" created="Mon, 4 Dec 2017 14:50:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=sboikov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;sboikov&quot;&gt;sboikov&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;br/&gt;
I&apos;ve remove EVT_NODE_JOINED from listener.&lt;br/&gt;
Job stealing is happened on EVT_NODE_METRICS_UPDATED as it was before, but now newly joined node is able to steal jobs.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Triggering stealing on EVT_NODE_JOINED has no effect. Seems, there is a race in event handling.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Let&apos;s merge this to master if you don&apos;t mind as it looks like almost fixed and &lt;br/&gt;
create a ticket for triggering job stealing on EVT_NODE_JOINED event?&lt;/p&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="16278133" author="sboikov" created="Tue, 5 Dec 2017 07:23:47 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged into master.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
